// 004.11, 005.11 (D35, #53): `Presumed False | True` on `Evidenced` facts supplies a default
// polarity while `Unresolved` (without masking `Conflicted`), and `Decides` resolves either way.
Fact person Identified by Walter, DrAdler, DrBose, Judge
Fact answer Identified by Yes, No
Evidenced Bool lacks-capacity Presumed False
Bool treated
Power consent-treatment Actor person
  Valid when person == Walter && !lacks-capacity()
  Creates treated()
Act certify-incapacity Actor person Holds when True Supports lacks-capacity()
Act certify-capacity Actor person Holds when True Rebuts lacks-capacity()
Finding rule-capacity Actor person Related to answer
  Decides lacks-capacity() By answer
  Valid when person == Judge && Conflicted(lacks-capacity())
.
?Unresolved(lacks-capacity()).
?valid consent-treatment(Walter).
certify-incapacity(DrAdler).
?Established(lacks-capacity()).
?!valid consent-treatment(Walter).
certify-capacity(DrBose).
?Conflicted(lacks-capacity()).
?undetermined consent-treatment(Walter).
rule-capacity(Judge, No).
?Refuted(lacks-capacity()).
?valid consent-treatment(Walter).
